    "media:imagetext": "COMPLETE TIMETABLE\nJULY 7, 1950\nSouthwest\nAirways\nBELLINGHAM\nPORT ANGELES\nPAA\nNWA\nPAA\nSHOQUIAM\nABERDEEN\nMT. VERNON\nANALUKIS\nEVERETT\nSEATTLE\nTACOMA\nOLYMPIA\nCENTRALIA\nCHEHALIS\nNWA\nASTORIA\n• PORTLAND_!\nUAL\nMcMINNVILLE\nALBANY\nCORVALLIS\nEUGENE\nNORTH BEND\nCOOS RAY\nMEDFORD\nYREKA\nASK ABOUT\nCRESCENT\nREDDING\nARCATA\nEUREKA\nRED BLUFF\n• ROUND TRIP DISCOUNT\nCHICO\nFORT BRAGG\n• UKIAH\nOROVILLE\nYUBA CITY\nMARYSVILLE\nSACRAMENTO\n• FAMILY PLAN FARES\nSANTA\nROSA\n• JOINT FARES\n(to eastern points)\nVALLEJO-NAPA\nOAKLAND--\nAA\nTWA\nSAN\nFRANCISCO,\nPAT\nUAL\n•\nSANTA CLARĂ\nSAN JOSE\nSANTA CRUZ\nWATSONVILLE\nMONTEREY\nCARMEL\nPASO ROBLES\nSAN\nLUI\nOBISPO\nPAA\nUAL\nSANTA MARIA\nSANTA\nBARBARA/N\nVAL\nOXNARD-VENTURA\nTWA WAL\nONTARIO-POMONA\nSAN BERNARDINO-RIVERSIDE\nBANNING - BEAUMONT\nPALM\nSPRINGS\nINDIO\nLOS ANGELES\n'BLYTHE\nLONG BEACH\nSANTA ANA - LAGUNA BEACH\nOCEANSIDE\nSAN DIEGO\nCENTRO\nTWA\nPHOENIX\nAJO\nLEGEND\nService now provided by West Coast Airlines will be\noperated by Southwest Airways upon approval by Civil\nAeronautics Board of merger of West Coast and South-\nwest.\nService by Southwest Airways between Los Angeles and\nPhoenix pending C.A.B. action.",
